OL,3,AFourteen go on trial over deadliest
OL,4,AChannel small boats disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FFourteen suspected people smugglers
OL,7,Fhave gone on trial in Paris for their
OL,8,Frole in the worst ever small boats
OL,9,Fdisaster in the English Channel.
OL,11,FIn November 2021, at least 30 men,
OL,12,Fwomen and children drowned when their
OL,13,Fmotorised dinghy deflated and started
OL,14,Ftaking on water halfway between France
OL,15,Fand the UK.
OL,17,FThe 14 defendants ` mainly Afghan
OL,18,Fnationals ` are accused of manslaughter
OL,19,Fand facilitating illegal immigration as
OL,20,Fpart of an organised criminal group.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
