OL,3,AFourteen go on trial over deadliest
OL,4,AChannel small boats disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost of them deny the charges. Two of
OL,7,Fthe 14, who are alleged to be leaders
OL,8,Fof the operation, remain on the run and
OL,9,Fare being tried in absentia.
